      </points>
    </raidCommonalityFromPointsCurve>
    <xenotypeSet Inherit="False">
      <xenotypeChances>
        <Genie MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.06</Genie>
        <Highmate MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.04</Highmate>
        <Pigskin MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Pigskin>
        <Neanderthal MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Neanderthal>
        <VRE_Lowmate MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,vanillaracesexpanded.highmate">0.03</VRE_Lowmate>
        <AG_Drakonori MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sarg.alphagenes">0.02</AG_Drakonori>
        <DevDesigner_XenotypeHighElves MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,DevDesigner.Elves.Continued">0.03</DevDesigner_XenotypeHighElves>
        <Orangutan MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,OnlyMonkey.AwakenedApes">0.02</Orangutan>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Open Hand</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>We were spared, and so we owe. The sick at the door are tended before the question of who they are, the body is kept whole and clean, and what the order has is held for whoever needs it next. The lamp Aldith hung over the first sickhouse door is kept lit in every one, so that anyone on the road at night can find it. A hospitaller's hand is open: it gives, and it is not raised first.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
