          <li>Council_Camp_Penitents</li>
        </camps>
        <plan>Rimfolk_Plan_Sickhouse</plan>
        <honours>the spared, clean hands and the night watch</honours>
        <fears>the fever's return and a door shut on the sick</fears>
        <sayings>
          <li>We were spared, and so we owe.</li>
