  <!-- ===================== Their people ===================== -->

  <!--
    How alike they look (docs/design/peoples.md "Their gear, their kinds of people and their gifts"): the order's habit is
    shared, not its cut or its age. Its lay servants, hospitallers, cellarers and prior wear an outer habit dyed the order's
    ivory: a plain robe, or with Vanilla Factions Expanded - Medieval 2 a mantle, the prior's a royal robe with Royalty;
    worn thin or newly made (gear health), of any cloth or leather, with a hood, a cap or a plague doctor's mask (Medieval 2),
    a skullcap or a headscarf (Vanilla Ideology Expanded - Hats and Rags, Ideology's headwrap) or bareheaded, prayer beads
    (Hats and Rags), now and then a prior in a bishop's mitre (Hats and Rags), the rest of what they wear their own. The sworn guards
    are soldiers and wear one kit: plate dyed ivory and
    a helmet, with Medieval 2 the order's ivory tabard over the plate and a heater shield; only wear, quality and a soldier's
    own touches differ (a gambeson or mail under the plate, plate gloves and boots, a battle banner with the Vanilla Expanded
    armour and accessories). The lay archers are its militia: a helmet, an ivory cape and a quiver (Vanilla Apparel Expanded
    - Accessories), padding where Vanilla Armour Expanded has it. Medieval weapons of the base game and the mods (Medieval 2's
    heavy maces, flails, war bows and arbalests, Vanilla Weapons Expanded's hammers, crossbows and longbows) under the game's
    tags. They carry herbs and clean cloth, with Alpha Crafts aloe salve and candles for the sickhouse lamp, with Alpha
    Animals a medicinal cactipine quill. A few are A RimWorld of Magic's priests (the hospitallers and their prior), paladins
    (the sworn guards) or rangers (the lay archers). Without any mod: the robe, the hood, plate and helmet, the base game's
    knives, maces, swords and bows.
  -->
  <PawnKindDef Name="Rimfolk_OrderKindBase" Abstract="True">
    <race>Human</race>
    <defaultFactionDef>Rimfolk_Order</defaultFactionDef>
    <chemicalAddictionChance>0</chemicalAddictionChance>
    <invNutrition>2.55</invNutrition>
    <maxGenerationAge>75</maxGenerationAge>
    <specificApparelRequirements>
      <!-- The order's ivory, on its habit and its guards' plate, whichever of them is worn. -->
      <li><apparelDef>Apparel_Robe</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
      <li><apparelDef>Apparel_Cape</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
      <li><apparelDef>Apparel_PlateArmor</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Royalty"><apparelDef>Apparel_RobeRoyal</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
      <li MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VFE.Medieval2"><apparelDef>VFEM2_Apparel_Mantle</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
      <li MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VFE.Medieval2"><apparelDef>VFEM2_Apparel_Tabard</apparelDef><color>(0.90, 0.88, 0.80)</color></li>
    </specificApparelRequirements>
  </PawnKindDef>

